Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: vdpau-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — VDPAU backend
 libvdpau_nvidia.so, the VDPAU hardware video acceleration backend.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64 i386
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-support-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 304.137 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-dkms
Architecture: amd64 i386
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 3.0.3)
Recommends: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs
Provides: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-MODULE
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — DKMS kernel module source
 DKMS source for the nvidia, nvidia-modeset, nvidia-drm and nvidia-uvm kernel
 modules from the 304.137 release. Rebuilt automatically for every installed
 kernel (Debian, Ubuntu HWE, mainline PPA and Ubuntu kernel PPA).
 Community patches extend build support to Linux <= 7.2.
